ncc ncc_off_active_t24 c6h6.bohr cc-pvdz ON OFF T 10 3 60 24 socket n ACTIVE
# zccsdt RCCSDT: 3 iterations
zc zc_rhf_t1 rhf c6h6.bohr cc-pvdz 6 3 0 70000 1 socket
zc zc_rhf_t2 rhf c6h6.bohr cc-pvdz 6 3 0 70000 2 socket
